{"asset_key":"ep7/quest_story_17215130","episode":"ep7","category":"quest_story","story_id":"17215130","schema_version":1,"lang":"jp","texts":{"say:1:1721513001:1":{"text":"おっ、我らが守備軍の大スターのお帰りだぜ。そんなに慌てて、まさか古聖堂が消えた一件でも追ってるのか？","source_cn":"哟，瞧瞧是谁回来了？咱们守备军的大明星啊。这么急匆匆的...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x0E3BABB9692CB5A3","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:2:1721513002:1":{"text":"なわけないだろ。あの事件には首を突っ込むなって、指揮官が誰かさんに命令したのを知らないのか？","source_cn":"别傻了。没听说吗？司令下了命令，严禁某些人参与此案。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x16A208CB61F24DE0","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:3:1721513003:1":{"text":"大事な大事な娘さんを、あんな危険な事件に関わらせるわけないだろ。万が一、その立派な鎧に傷でもついたらどうするんだ。","source_cn":"这么危险的案子，司令大人怎么舍得让他那娇贵的女儿去冒险...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x052A0E395E6FBA34","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:4:1721513004:1":{"text":"いやあ、祭典の観兵式で注目を浴びるはずだったのに、残念だったなあ。あの見せ場のために、一週間ぐらいかけてせっせと鎧を磨いたんじゃないか？","source_cn":"真是遗憾。本来庆典上的军事献演可是某人的高光时刻。为了...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xF14CC7D62F15E3B1","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:5:1721513005:1":{"text":"なのに古聖堂が消えたせいで、皆の関心もすっかりそっちに持っていかれちまった。これじゃ、もう誰もあのご立派な雄姿を覚えてないだろうなあ。","source_cn":"圣古堂没了，所有人的注意都被夺走了，这下没人记得她的英姿了。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x2F2FBEA7892EC96A","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:8:1721513006:0":{"text":"ギイ、ホーレン！無礼だぞ！","source_cn":"盖伊、呼伦，住口！你们放尊重点——","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x6763AFC4CD572142","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:10:1721513007:0":{"text":"おー、こわ。いいよなぁ、偉大な一族に生まれさえすれば――","source_cn":"噢——有人急了。看到了吗？这就是有个伟大家族的好处。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xF3767CE40CBF4F4F","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:11:1721513008:0":{"text":"本人は何も言わなくても、そこに立っているだけで、忠実な番犬くんが主人の代わりに吠えてくれるんだからよ。","source_cn":"根本不需要自己开口，只要站在那里，就会有忠诚的卫士跳出...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xDA1B804AB42FDF93","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:12:1721513009:1":{"text":"まったくだぜ。俺だって、親父がブライトの盾なら、木刀を軽く振っただけで小隊長にでもなれたんだろうな。","source_cn":"可不是嘛。如果我父亲是耀光之盾，哪怕我只会拿着木剑挥舞...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xB81C580862E4ABC4","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:13:1721513010:1":{"text":"なあ、マーチン。お前がそんなに必死こいてアピールしてるのも、昇進候補に名前が挙がってるからだろ？","source_cn":"马丁，你这么卖力地表现，之后的晋升名单上肯定有你吧？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xD6A8FC21B5721992","variant_status":"","male":"","female":